#### 3. `app.js` — actual code issues

The app itself is small and doesn't have classic injection flaws (no SQL, no `eval`, no shell calls, no user input reflected). But it's missing standard hardening:

| Issue | Severity | Recommendation |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| No security headers | Medium | Add `helmet` |
| No rate limiting | Medium | Add `express-rate-limit` |
